{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For what real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, other than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/84574de7797bc7b4e1fc52075f4d265ba60a8bce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, does the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/8/fe8bfe21c047f1e6b731c3a99c94b1f08c70aa09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + kx + k^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"133\" height=\"16\" /> have real roots?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/a/f9a21d9d02cd06eefac5a7d3f19452c613eb8c31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ {k &lt; 0}\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ {k &gt; 0} \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ {k \\ge 1} \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{all values of }{k}\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{no values of }{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"636\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An expression of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d13ac0e00358ad3fa8b0d6db3217b8a10cc7d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" /> has at least one real root when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36ad95a69b2e32b2ac2d33ebbc19f414b921d605.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2-4ac \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/5/0e5c83cc0c639fc2ed843bbe2d3d209fb478b104.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, we have \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/a/8bafbc8b780624858927dfaa7bd0341b0059dcbf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[k^2-4k^2 \\geq 0\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/7/677866618f6edd311316f2a60d47bb37e5309981.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-3k^2 \\geq 0\\]\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>but the range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cf3ff62ca0e8a7d5ff42490fa04bcc3644ba43f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3k^2$\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/d/50d25d3e486146edd225ea505aaa53016f41edb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-\\infty,0]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/c/e6c182d936b9ff33cadf7f6e3391eeddf9248a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"36\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a